{"_v":3,"id":"amelie-west-end-2021","cat":"west-end","bd":{"positive":3,"mixed":1,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Jessie Thompson","o":"Evening Standard","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/amelie-the-musical-review-a-charming-silly-delight-for-when-the-world-feels-merde-a4303876.html","d":"2019-12-04","q":"It sags slightly when there are too many soppy love songs...But the world feels merde, and this charming show brings some much-needed silly delight."},{"cn":"Alice Saville","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/amelie-the-musical-review","d":"2021-08-02","q":"This production doesn't fix 'Amélie the Musical', but mon dieu it makes it fun."},{"cn":"Mark Shenton","o":"London Theatre","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/review-amelie-at-the-other-palace","d":"2019-12-05","q":"This slice of Paris life comes alive."},{"cn":"Phil Willmott","o":"London Box Office","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/review-amelie-other-palace","d":"2019-12-16","q":"This delightful, life affirming show is the perfect tonic to our gloomy, post-election, winter."}],"hi":"/images/shows/amelie-west-end-2021/hero.webp"}